#!/usr/bin/env perl
#
# Validate one or more contributor files.
#
# I know, it's perl - isn't that crazy?! I would have liked to use bash, but i
# wasn't able to validate the emoji in a consistent way that handled compound
# emojis.  don't deep-dive into emojis - they are a stupid rabbit hole and omg
# they are hard to validate lol.  but, perl can do it kinda.
#
